                                                "sense_id": "d55b4b7a-125f-300a-9fd3-2c457a85e494",
                                                "text": "“I brought a box cutter from work,” I say to Geraldine, and pull it out of my jacket pocket and slide the plastic clip up to show her the blade—like she doesn’t know what a box cutter is."
